OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers persisting this evening mixed
OL,7,Fwith clear spells into the night.
OL,8,FTurning cloudier through the early
OL,9,Fhours with some rain but this clearing
OL,10,Fby dawn. Staying breezy helping to
OL,11,Fkeep temperatures generally up
OL,12,Fovernight.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FDry at first, but increasingly
OL,15,Fcloudy as rain moves in from the west
OL,16,Fduring the morning. Turning heavy for
OL,17,Fa time, especially over western hills.
OL,18,FRather windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
