OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FPatchy
OL,6,Frain on Saturday, then drier on Sunday
OL,7,Fwith sunny spells but blustery
OL,8,Fwesterly winds. Cloudy on Monday with
OL,9,Fsome drizzle and a little warmer too
OL,10,Fwith lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
